  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven : 36 - 3 ÷ 3 + 2 × 4 = 34\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the signs :\n\nOption 1) - and +\n\n36 - 3 ÷ 3 + 2 × 4 = 34 ⇒ 36 + 3 ÷ 3 - 2 × 4 = 34\n\n⇒ 36 + __**3 ÷ 3**__ - 2 × 4 = 34\n\n⇒ 36 + 1 - __**2 × 4**__ = 34\n\n⇒ __**36 + 1**__ - 8 = 34\n\n⇒ __**37 - 8**__ = 34\n\n⇒ 29 ≠ 34 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) + and ÷\n\n36 - 3 ÷ 3 + 2 × 4 = 34 ⇒ 36 - 3 + 3 ÷ 2 × 4 = 34\n\n⇒ 36 - 3 + __**3 **____**÷**____** 2**__ × 4 = 34\n\n⇒ 36 - 3 + __**1.5**____** × 4**__ = 34\n\n⇒ __**36 + 60**__ - 3 = 34\n\n⇒ __**96 - 3**__ = 34 \n\n⇒ 93 ≠ 34 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) - and ×\n\n36 - 3 ÷ 3 + 2 × 4 = 34 ⇒ 36 × 3 ÷ 3 + 2 - 4 = 34\n\n⇒ 36 × __**3 ÷ 3**__ + 2 - 4 = 34\n\n⇒ __**36 ×**____** 1**__ + 2 - 4 = 34\n\n⇒ __**36**____** + 2**__ - 4 = 34\n\n⇒ __**38 - 4**__ = 34\n\n**⇒ 34 = 34 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 4) ÷ and -\n\n36 - 3 ÷ 3 + 2 × 4 = 34 ⇒ 36 ÷ 3 - 3 + 2 × 4 = 34\n\n⇒ __**36 ÷**____** 3**__ - 3 + 2 × 4 = 34\n\n⇒ 12 - 3 + __**2 × 4**__ = 34\n\n⇒ __**12 + 8**__ - 3 = 34\n\n⇒ __**20 - 3**__ = 34\n\n⇒ 17 ≠ 34 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.",
